WEBVTT

1
00:00.140 --> 00:01.640
So I just went into…

2
00:01.760 --> 00:05.220
I was trying to get into J5, and I was in J4,

3
00:05.220 --> 00:11.560
and I noticed all this tension that I hadn’t noticed there before.

4
00:12.140 --> 00:15.100
And I spent, like, 20 minutes kind of dissolving it.

5
00:15.500 --> 00:21.300
And then it just felt like a deep reset of my nervous system afterwards.

6
00:21.440 --> 00:24.820
And I just feel so much more alive today.

7
00:25.680 --> 00:33.660
It reminded me of a blog post by Sasha Chapin called “Deep Okayness.”

8
00:34.560 --> 00:40.840
As soon as I finished the jhana sit, I went and read it, and it really resonated.

9
00:41.220 --> 00:47.140
Where he got deep okayness was completely different. It wasn’t with jhanas,

10
00:47.260 --> 00:54.700
but it felt the same to me: the problems he had before, and what the resolution felt like after.

11
00:55.000 --> 00:56.000
So that was amazing.

